<title>USA: AmeriCredit proposes $100 mln offering.</title>
<headline>AmeriCredit proposes $100 mln offering.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriCredit Corp said Wednesday it had proposed to make a private offering of $100 million aggregate principal amount of senior notes due 2004.  </p>
<p>The company said it was going to use the money to fund its growth, including raising the amount of car and other loans it can buy and hold for pooling and sale in the asset-backed securities market.</p>
<p>AmeriCredit is a consumer financing company.</p>
</text>
